cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Rthoptera Desk"
abstract: >-
  Cross-platform desktop application for insect bioacoustics analysis:
  spectral and temporal measurement of insect calls, annotation of motifs
  with per-species frequency bands, and publication-quality oscillogram
  and spectrogram figures. Desktop counterpart to the Rthoptera R package.
authors:
  - family-names: Rivas
    given-names: Francisco
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1256-2225"
version: "0.5.1"
date-released: "2026-08-18"
url: "https://github.com/panchorivasf/Rthoptera-Desk"
repository-code: "https://github.com/panchorivasf/Rthoptera-Desk"
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
keywords:
  - bioacoustics
  - entomology
  - Orthoptera
  - acoustic analysis
  - spectrogram
  - animal communication
references:
  # The Auto-coded Oscillogram implements this method; cite it alongside
  # Rthoptera Desk in any work that uses that module.
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Colour Enhanced Time/Pressure Envelope (CETPE), a novel on-screen
      rendering of digital sound
    authors:
      - family-names: Brizio
        given-names: C.
    year: 2023
    journal: "Rivista Italiana di Acustica"
    volume: 48
    issue: 2
